        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-hero-content">
        <h3><span>⚡</span> Nexora Predictive Early-Warning</h3>
        <p class="muted" id="dashAiMessage" style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.5;">
          Your test scores are solid, but your attendance requires attention for exam eligibility.
