        <button class="chip-prompt" onclick="askQuickPrompt('Explain B-Trees vs B+ Trees with DBMS use cases.')">📌 B-Trees vs B+ Trees</button>
        <button class="chip-prompt" onclick="askQuickPrompt('Explain the 4 Coffman conditions for Deadlock.')">📌 OS Deadlock</button>
